{
  "title": "Phase 2 benchmark: model x context",
  "description": "Lanternfly Labs data agent. 64 questions x 3 context levels x 2 models x 3 reps. Phase 2 (Oct 16) and the context-fix rerun phase2-v2 (Oct 17). Accuracy comes from the backfilled 'correct' feedback.",
  "project": "agent-ready-analytics",
  "feedback_key": "correct",
  "window": {
    "start": "2026-10-16T16:00:00Z",
    "end": "2026-10-18T03:00:00Z"
  },
  "models": {
    "Haiku": "anthropic:claude-haiku-5-5",
    "Gemma": "ollama:gemma4:26b"
  },
  "outcomes": {
    "correct": "eq(feedback_score, 1)",
    "wrong": "and(eq(feedback_score, 0), eq(status, \"success\"))",
    "step_limit": "eq(status, \"error\")"
  },
  "charts": [
    {
      "chart_type": "text",
      "markdown": "### Does governed context matter more than the model?\nYes. With only raw tables, Haiku answers 66% correctly. With the governed context layer, local Gemma 4 26B reaches 83%, and Haiku reaches 99%.\n\nThe two models peak on different layers. Haiku is best with **docs** (99.5%), and Gemma is best with **full** (83.3%) because the semantic layer cuts its tool-call loops."
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 2 runs",
      "chart_type": "kpi",
      "series": [{"name": "Runs", "run": "phase2", "metric": "run_count"}]
    },
    {
      "title": "Haiku API cost, Phase 2",
      "chart_type": "kpi",
      "description": "Gemma ran locally on an RTX 3090, so it has no API cost.",
      "series": [{"name": "Cost", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "metric": "total_cost"}]
    },
    {
      "title": "Accuracy by model and context (Phase 2)",
      "chart_type": "bar",
      "description": "Share of runs scored correct against the held-out answer key.",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Haiku raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "raw",  "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Haiku docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "docs", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Haiku full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "raw",  "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "docs", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Outcomes: Haiku (Phase 2)",
      "chart_type": "pie",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Correct",    "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "outcome": "correct",    "metric": "run_count"},
        {"name": "Wrong",      "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "outcome": "wrong",      "metric": "run_count"},
        {"name": "Step limit", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "outcome": "step_limit", "metric": "run_count"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Outcomes: Gemma (Phase 2)",
      "chart_type": "pie",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Correct",    "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "outcome": "correct",    "metric": "run_count"},
        {"name": "Wrong",      "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "outcome": "wrong",      "metric": "run_count"},
        {"name": "Step limit", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "outcome": "step_limit", "metric": "run_count"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step-limit rate by context (Gemma)",
      "chart_type": "bar",
      "description": "Runs that hit the 60-step LangGraph limit. Haiku never did.",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Gemma raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "raw",  "metric": "error_rate"},
        {"name": "Gemma docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "docs", "metric": "error_rate"},
        {"name": "Gemma full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "error_rate"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Median tokens per run",
      "chart_type": "bar",
      "description": "Raw context costs Haiku about 3x the tokens of docs or full.",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Haiku raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "raw",  "metric": "median_tokens"},
        {"name": "Haiku docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "docs", "metric": "median_tokens"},
        {"name": "Haiku full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "full", "metric": "median_tokens"},
        {"name": "Gemma raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "raw",  "metric": "median_tokens"},
        {"name": "Gemma docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "docs", "metric": "median_tokens"},
        {"name": "Gemma full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "median_tokens"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Median latency (s)",
      "chart_type": "bar",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Haiku raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "raw",  "metric": "latency_p50"},
        {"name": "Haiku docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "docs", "metric": "latency_p50"},
        {"name": "Haiku full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "full", "metric": "latency_p50"},
        {"name": "Gemma raw",  "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "raw",  "metric": "latency_p50"},
        {"name": "Gemma docs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "docs", "metric": "latency_p50"},
        {"name": "Gemma full", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "latency_p50"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Context-fix rerun: accuracy before and after",
      "chart_type": "bar",
      "description": "phase2 = original context, phase2-v2 = dimension-description and contract-ARR doc fixes. Raw context was not rerun.",
      "series": [
        {"name": "Haiku full, before", "run": "phase2",    "model": "Haiku", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Haiku full, after",  "run": "phase2-v2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma full, before", "run": "phase2",    "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma full, after",  "run": "phase2-v2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Haiku docs, before", "run": "phase2",    "model": "Haiku", "level": "docs", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Haiku docs, after",  "run": "phase2-v2", "model": "Haiku", "level": "docs", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma docs, before", "run": "phase2",    "model": "Gemma", "level": "docs", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"},
        {"name": "Gemma docs, after",  "run": "phase2-v2", "model": "Gemma", "level": "docs", "metric": "feedback_score_avg"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "chart_type": "text",
      "markdown": "**Notes.** Charts include only root traces that carry the `correct` feedback, so the counts match `evals/results/*/runs.jsonl` exactly. Latency is LangSmith's trace duration and runs slightly above the harness's `latency_s`. Bootstrap confidence intervals and per-trap accuracy are in the benchmark report and figures, not here."
    }
  ]
}
